      "text": "With `--acp`, runs route through the Agent Client Protocol to emit a typed event stream (agent_message_chunk, tool_call, plan_update, stop_reason) instead of raw stdout; ACP adapters are documented for claude, codex, cursor, opencode, openclaw, and grok."
