      ],
      "text": "In direct-exec runs, `--mode skip` forwards each harness's native bypass flag (e.g. --dangerously-skip-permissions for Claude Code, --yolo for Gemini); under `--acp`, skip is granted at the ACP protocol layer by selecting allow_always or the first offered permission option."
